SingleMultiple <pre><code>{
    "attribute": "minecraft:burning_time",
    "id": "example:longer_burning_time",
    "amount": 1.0,
    "operation": "add_multiplied_total"
}
</code></pre> <p>This example doubles the base value of the <code>minecraft:burning_time</code> attribute of the entity, which is used as a multiplier for how long the entity will burn. $(Total = Base * (1 + 1.0))$</p> <pre><code>[
    {
        "attribute": "minecraft:armor",
        "id": "example:tuff",
        "amount": 1.0,
        "operation": "add_multiplied_base"
    },
    {
        "attribute": "minecraft:armor",
        "id": "example:so_tuff",
        "amount": 3.0,
        "operation": "add_multiplied_base"
    }
]
</code></pre> <p>This example multiplies the base value of the <code>minecraft:armor</code> attribute by the sum of the modifiers' amounts. $(Total = Base + 1.0 + 3.0)$</p>

